The independent checks support acceptance. Apple’s current documentation confirms the corrected app-message launch behavior and the file-based/System-keychain API split; the physical harness reproduced system-domain resolution and scoped SecItem behavior without touching real secrets. The only failing gate at this moment is `task-board validate`: its process exit code is 0, but it reports the known transient parent-status mismatch while this leaf is `reviewing`. I’ll record that honestly in the verdict, route the accepted leaf, and rerun validation after the status transition.
